==Trivia==
*The name Crimson Star may also be a reference to DC Comics' [[wikipedia:Superman|Superman]], whose home planet [[wikia:superman:Krypton|Krypton]] had a red sun. This is supported by the base, which looks like Superman, standing on top of crystals, like in [[wikipedia:Richard Donner|Richard Donner]]'s [[wikipedia:Superman (1978 film)|1978 Superman film]]. Moreover, the Taiwanese version's [[Treasure]] is "The Strongest Man in History", and Crimson and Krypton are spelled almost the same in Japanese - the stage's Japanese name can be translated as Planet Krymson.

